<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Vitrine Studio – third-party notices</title>
<style>
  body { font: 14px/1.5 -apple-system, "Segoe UI", system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 60rem; margin: 2rem auto; padding: 0 1rem; color: #222; background: #fff; }
  h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; } h2 { font-size: 1.15rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
  pre { white-space: pre-wrap; background: #f5f5f5; padding: .75rem; font-size: 12px; }
  ul.crates { columns: 3 14rem; padding-left: 1rem; font-size: 12px; }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) { body { color: #ddd; background: #161616; } pre { background: #222; } a { color: #8ab4f8; } }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Vitrine Studio – third-party notices</h1>
<p>Vitrine Studio is free software, licensed under the GNU General Public
License v3 or later (GPL-3.0-or-later). The corresponding source code of
this build is the Git tag of this release at
<a href="https://github.com/vitrinestudio-app/vitrine">github.com/vitrinestudio-app/vitrine</a>.</p>
<p>Vitrine Studio includes the following third-party components. The bundled
fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1) and hyphenation patterns have their own
licence files next to this file: <code>fonts/</code> and
<code>hyphenation/LICENSES.md</code>.</p>

<h2>Rust crates – overview</h2>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}
  <li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>

<h2>Rust crates – licence texts</h2>
{{#each licenses}}
<section>
  <h3 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h3>
  <p>Used by:</p>
  <ul class="crates">
  {{#each used_by}}
    <li><a href="{{#if crate.repository}}{{crate.repository}}{{else}}https://crates.io/crates/{{crate.name}}{{/if}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a></li>
  {{/each}}
  </ul>
  <pre>{{text}}</pre>
</section>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
